{"title":"Mossback Ancient","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Mossback that attacks with crush (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (3.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>129</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>139</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>129</td><td>in the wilds around 2259, 1463</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>139</td><td>in the wilds around 2250, 1475</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"mossback-ancient\" data-map-level=\"49\">Show level 49 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 5 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shell-stone\" title=\"Shell Stone - in 60% of 5 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 6 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c64481875084d7ec0d03.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shell Stone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">60% · 3/5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ancient-moss\" title=\"Ancient Moss - in 60% of 5 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d586c8d80dfb5cdeac77.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ancient Moss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">60% · 3/5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"living-moss\" title=\"Living Moss - in 20% of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0a59352953e2cefa4996.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Living Moss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20% · 1/5</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1540.5px,-2944.6px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/5/11.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:2816px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/6/11.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:2816px\"><i style=\"left:1548.2px;top:2961.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1555.0px;top:2970.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1544.3px;top:2924.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1564.6px;top:2918.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1488.7px;top:2951.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1563.0px;top:2936.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1479.3px;top:2951.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1514.2px;top:2966.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1572.7px;top:2903.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1465.7px;top:2972.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1540.0px;top:2926.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1649.8px;top:2952.6px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2254, 1470 <span class=\"muted\">· 12 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 9 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"mossback-ancient\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mossback: <a href=\"#/monster/mossback\">Mossback</a> <span class=\"muted\">(48)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/cffbdf7d80a1f1840dde.webp\" alt=\"Mossback Ancient\"></div><h3>Mossback Ancient</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>49</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 50)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Mossback</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>290</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>31.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,450</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td